{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This tool is mainly used by game designers to configure and experience the lottery (gacha) feel. The lottery method set by the tool works as follows: first draw from the <strong>Tier 1 Prize Pool</strong>, then use the result from the Tier 1 Prize Pool to index the <strong>Tier 2 Prize Pool</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different prize pools and rewards can also be configured with <strong>guaranteed draw counts</strong> (pity counts), allowing flexible configuration and testing. Additionally, the tool stores and counts the results of each draw, facilitating subsequent analysis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It supports customizing item icons, item names, and item rarities, with configurations managed via Excel documents (.xlsx).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027340/extras/8052cecb7fdadf6d1f77c86d7d0eb827.poster.avif?t=1762249813\" width=1170 height=676 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027340/extras/8052cecb7fdadf6d1f77c86d7d0eb827.webm?t=1762249813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027340/extras/425ca108ef9bc3289d47162acc490836.poster.avif?t=1762249813\" width=1170 height=676 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027340/extras/425ca108ef9bc3289d47162acc490836.webm?t=1762249813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com